    What actually decides whether copy and video fit side by side is whether
    the viewport is WIDER THAN IT IS TALL. So: any landscape viewport with room
    for two columns, plus anything genuinely wide, which keeps portrait tablets
    on it.

    820px is measured, not picked. The hero bottoms out around 394px on its own
